```

The issue is `lastSeen[0]` is always using the first element of the array, regardless of the index `idx`. This would cause all tokens to have the same (wrong) lastSeen value. Let me also check if there's a similar issue in other parts of the code. Let me also look at how tokens are stored and retrieved.

```bash
