```

THOUGHT: Both fixes have been applied:
1. Line 37: Changed `lastSeen[0]` to `lastSeen[idx]` - this fixes the issue where all tokens had the same wrong lastSeen value
2. Lines 55, 64: Changed `tokens:${token}` to `token:${token}` in the generate and update functions - this fixes the issue where tokens were being stored in one key namespace (`tokens:`) but retrieved from another (`token:`), causing tokens to not be found

